course: dictionary
lesson: 14233
title: Words with more than one meaning: nativity
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. The word nativity can mean the birth of Jesus, or simply a birth. Context tells you which meaning is right. Look for clues like Christmas, play, church, scene or stable.
explain: «Our class performed the nativity play in the school hall.» A play that tells the Christmas story is a nativity play. The clues are play, school and Christmas. Try your meaning in the sentence: a play about the birth of Jesus fits well.
explain: «Mia set up the nativity scene on the windowsill.» A nativity scene is a model or picture of the stable with Mary, Joseph, baby Jesus, shepherds, wise men and animals. The clue is that she set it up, like a model you build. Ask what fits, then check.
fact: Nativity comes from the word for birth.
fact: The Nativity, with a capital N, is the birth of Jesus in Bethlehem, as told in the Gospels.
fact: Christians celebrate the Nativity at Christmas.
fact: A nativity play is often acted out by children at school or church.
fact: A nativity scene is a model or picture of the stable with Mary, Joseph, baby Jesus, shepherds, wise men and animals.
exercise: «Our class performed the nativity play at church.» What is a nativity play? | A school trip to the seaside | A race held on sports day | *A play that tells the Christmas story | A game played in the playground
exercise: «Mia set up the nativity scene on the windowsill.» What is a nativity scene? | A picture of the sea | A map of the school grounds | A kind of ice cream | *A model or picture of the stable with Mary, Joseph and baby Jesus
exercise: «The Nativity tells how Jesus was born.» Where was Jesus born, according to the Nativity? | Belfast | *Bethlehem | Brighton | Bristol
test: Kayla said, «The nativity of my baby sister was the best day of my life.» What does nativity mean here? | A church song | A model stable | A school play | *The birth of a person
test: «Our church has a nativity scene next to the Christmas tree.» Which is a nativity scene? | A church bell | A winter coat | A kind of Christmas tree | *A model or picture of the stable with the baby Jesus
exam: Which phrase names a school play that tells the Christmas story? | *Nativity play | Bonfire night | Harvest festival | Sports day
